   "planned_path": "P5",
   "scion_answer": "The decimal expansion of $\\frac{1}{7}$ is $0.142857142857142857\\dots$, where the block $142857$ repeats every 6 digits.\n\nTo find the $2007^{\\text{th}}$ digit:\n$$2007 = 6 \\times 334 + 3$$\n\nSo the $2007^{\\text{th}}$ digit corresponds to the $3^{\\text{rd}}$ digit in the repeating block $142857$, which is $2$.\n\n$\\boxed{2}$",
